        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏦 Build and Expand Your Bank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start with a small service desk and grow your bank from the ground up.<br>Open new areas, upgrade your services, organize the layout, and shape your bank in your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👔 Serve Customers Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Verify IDs, complete transactions, approve loans, and manage the line.<br>Customer patience decreases — manage the flow well or they’ll leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Loans, Fees &amp; Research Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1f365fc0dd5436b25163b8d0409916ed.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1f365fc0dd5436b25163b8d0409916ed.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1f365fc0dd5436b25163b8d0409916ed.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Progress through a wide research tree to unlock new systems:<br>More Income, Better Customer Relations, ATM, Decorations, Advertising, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your bank grows, financial decisions matter too — set service fees, manage loans, and choose the right level of risk.<br>Good decisions help your bank grow… bad ones slow you down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Decorate Your Bank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/2296676c7be49700ab3f82b8452c3ad6.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/2296676c7be49700ab3f82b8452c3ad6.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/2296676c7be49700ab3f82b8452c3ad6.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Add decorations to make your bank warmer, cleaner, or more professional.<br>Every decoration increases prestige and boosts customer satisfaction. Higher prestige attracts wealthier, more patient, and more profitable customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Your Bank. Your Rules.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, upgrade, research, and shape everything yourself.<br>Grow from a small branch into a major financial center.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏦 Build and Expand Your Bank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start with a small service desk and grow your bank from the ground up.<br>Open new areas, upgrade your services, organize the layout, and shape your bank in your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👔 Serve Customers Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Verify IDs, complete transactions, approve loans, and manage the line.<br>Customer patience decreases — manage the flow well or they’ll leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Loans, Fees &amp; Research Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1f365fc0dd5436b25163b8d0409916ed.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1f365fc0dd5436b25163b8d0409916ed.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1f365fc0dd5436b25163b8d0409916ed.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Progress through a wide research tree to unlock new systems:<br>More Income, Better Customer Relations, ATM, Decorations, Advertising, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your bank grows, financial decisions matter too — set service fees, manage loans, and choose the right level of risk.<br>Good decisions help your bank grow… bad ones slow you down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Decorate Your Bank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/2296676c7be49700ab3f82b8452c3ad6.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/2296676c7be49700ab3f82b8452c3ad6.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/2296676c7be49700ab3f82b8452c3ad6.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Add decorations to make your bank warmer, cleaner, or more professional.<br>Every decoration increases prestige and boosts customer satisfaction. Higher prestige attracts wealthier, more patient, and more profitable customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Your Bank. Your Rules.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, upgrade, research, and shape everything yourself.<br>Grow from a small branch into a major financial center.</p>",
